{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "auth-collection-v1",
    "name": "Authentication API",
    "description": "Comprehensive authentication endpoints for Live Music Finder API\n\n## Getting Started\n1. Set up Google OAuth Credentials\n2. Configure environment variables\n3. Follow the OAuth flow step-by-step\n\n### Authentication Flow\n1. Get Google ID Token\n2. Exchange for JWT\n3. Use JWT for authenticated requests\n\n### Environment Setup\n- GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID: Your Google OAuth Client ID\n- GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET: Your Google OAuth Client Secret\n- Callback URL will be automatically configured",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. OAuth Configuration",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Google OAuth Credentials",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials",
              "protocol": "https",
              "host": ["console", "cloud", "google", "com"],
              "path": ["apis", "credentials"]
            },
            "description": "Steps to get Google OAuth Credentials:\n1. Go to Google Cloud Console\n2. Create a new project or select existing\n3. Navigate to Credentials\n4. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID\n5. Set Authorized JavaScript origins and redirect URIs\n6. Copy Client ID and Client Secret to environment variables"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OAuth Configuration",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('OAuth variables are configured', function() {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.environment.get('GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID')).to.not.be.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.environment.get('GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET')).to.not.be.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.environment.get('GOOGLE_OAUTH_CALLBACK_URL')).to.not.be.empty;",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{GOOGLE_AUTH_URL}}?client_id={{GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID}}&redirect_uri={{GOOGLE_OAUTH_CALLBACK_URL}}&response_type=code&scope={{GOOGLE_SCOPES}}",
              "host": ["{{GOOGLE_AUTH_URL}}"],
              "query": [
                {"key": "client_id", "value": "{{GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID}}"},
                {"key": "redirect_uri", "value": "{{GOOGLE_OAUTH_CALLBACK_URL}}"},
                {"key": "response_type", "value": "code"},
                {"key": "scope", "value": "{{GOOGLE_SCOPES}}"}
              ]
            },
            "description": "Verify OAuth configuration by constructing authorization URL\n\n### What this does:\n- Checks if OAuth variables are correctly set\n- Generates a valid Google OAuth authorization URL\n- Ensures all required parameters are present"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Authentication Flows",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login with Google",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Successful login', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const jsonResponse = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonResponse).to.have.property('token');",
                  "    pm.environment.set('JWT', jsonResponse.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('userId', jsonResponse.user.id);",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"googleIdToken\": \"{{GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Exchange Google ID Token for JWT\n\n### Prerequisites\n1. Obtain Google ID Token via OAuth flow\n2. Paste token in GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN environment variable\n\n### What this does:\n- Validates Google ID Token\n- Creates or logs in user\n- Returns JWT for subsequent authenticated requests"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User Profile",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Profile retrieved successfully', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const profile = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(profile).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(profile).to.have.property('email');",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{JWT}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/profile",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieve authenticated user's profile\n\n### Requirements\n- Must have valid JWT\n- JWT obtained from successful login\n\n### What this does:\n- Returns full user profile\n- Confirms authentication status"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Logout successful', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.environment.unset('JWT');",
                  "    pm.environment.unset('userId');",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{JWT}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Invalidate current JWT and log out user\n\n### What this does:\n- Revokes current authentication token\n- Clears server-side session\n- Requires valid JWT"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Error Scenarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Invalid Token Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Invalid token handled', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "})"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"googleIdToken\": \"invalid_token_example\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Test authentication with invalid Google ID Token\n\n### Expected Behavior\n- 401 Unauthorized\n- No JWT issued"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
